Handed off to review. `TASK-260715-mocqmr` is now `to-review` with 12/12 checklist items complete.

Key results:

- Added macOS sandbox and Linux Landlock/seccomp containment in [relay_asset_smoke.py](/Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel/scripts/relay_asset_smoke.py).
- Added detached-child, external-write, report-privacy, and exit-code regressions in [test_relay_asset_smoke.py](/Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel/scripts/tests/test_relay_asset_smoke.py).
- 17/17 tests pass; affected coverage is 81.1%.
- Rebuilt and verified all four assets.
- Native Darwin arm64 gate passed 17/17 checks; 20/20 stress runs retained SIGTERM exit 130.
- Go tests/vet, Actionlint, Black, supply-chain and toolchain checks pass.
- Revised outcome and exact native report are attached to the board.

The other three native targets remain correctly delegated to mandatory CI runners; no remote CI execution is claimed. `task-board validate` exits 0 but still reports the pre-existing ancestor status mismatch for `EPIC-260715-2lz67t`.
